					&lt;h2&gt;Signs Your Drain Problem Needs Proper Attention&lt;/h2&gt;				
		&lt;p&gt;Blocked drains rarely fix themselves for long. If the same sink, toilet, shower or outside gully keeps giving trouble, there is usually a build-up, obstruction or pipe condition that needs a proper look.&lt;/p&gt;		
