									&lt;h3&gt;
							Slow Drainage						
					&lt;/h3&gt;
									&lt;p&gt;
						Water that drains slowly from a sink, shower, bath or outside gully can point to grease, soap build-up, sand, roots or a narrowing in the line.					&lt;/p&gt;
