									&lt;h3&gt;
							Bad Smells						
					&lt;/h3&gt;
									&lt;p&gt;
						Sewer smells around bathrooms, kitchens or outdoor drains often mean waste is sitting in the pipe instead of moving away properly.					&lt;/p&gt;
