									&lt;h3&gt;
							Repeat Blockages						
					&lt;/h3&gt;
									&lt;p&gt;
						A drain that clears and blocks again needs more than another quick attempt. The cause may sit deeper in the line.					&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;p&gt;OUR APPROACH&lt;/p&gt;				
