					&lt;h2&gt;Other Plumbing Services That Often Connect to Drain Problems&lt;/h2&gt;				
		&lt;p&gt;Blocked drains often overlap with other plumbing issues. These related services help users move deeper into the site and give Google clearer internal links between service topics.&lt;/p&gt;		
